@startuml Dev Observability Flow
title Dev-Only Observability — API Inspector (Cmd+Shift+A)

!theme plain
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Developer" as Dev

package "Frontend  ·  dev build only" as FE {
  node "Any domain hook\n(38 hooks emit automatically)" as Hook
  node "apiRequest()\nlib/api/client.ts" as ApiClient
  node "apiEventBus\nmodule pub-sub" as Bus
  node "apiRequestLog\nring buffer (200)" as Log
  node "queryMetrics\nTanStack stats aggregator" as Metrics
  node "devtoolsHotkey\nCmd+Shift+A / Ctrl+Shift+A" as Hotkey
  node "DevtoolsRoot (lazy)" as Root
  node "ApiInspector\n(filter + virtualised list)" as Inspector
}

package "Backend API" as BE {
  node "requestId middleware\nAsyncLocalStorage" as RequestContext
  node "shared logger\nambient requestId" as BackendLogger
}

Hook --> ApiClient : useQuery / useMutation
ApiClient --> RequestContext : fetch + auth + X-Request-Id
RequestContext --> ApiClient : envelope + X-Request-Id
RequestContext --> BackendLogger : async request context
ApiClient --> Bus : emit ApiRequestEvent\n(start, success, error)
Bus --> Log       : append (drop oldest)
Bus --> Metrics   : update p50 / p95 / cache-hit
Dev --> Hotkey    : keypress
Hotkey --> Root   : import.meta.env.DEV gate
Root --> Inspector: React.lazy + Suspense
Inspector --> Log     : useApiRequestLog()
Inspector --> Metrics : useQueryMetrics()

note right of Inspector
  Renders:
   - request list (virtualised)
   - request detail pane
   - metrics panel (errors, cache hit)
   - top endpoints (p50, p95)
   - slow requests (>1s)
   - in-flight counter on the toggle
end note

note right of Root
  Lazy chunk: fetched only when the gate
  renders it (dev build flag or Admin Mode).
  No load cost until activated.
  Zero cost when inspector is closed
  (no subscribers on the event bus).
end note

@enduml
